install time, under SigmaHQ's own licence.

── IANA Root Zone Database (top-level domain list) ────────────────────────

share/.common/tlds.txt reproduces the list of delegated top-level domains
published by the Internet Assigned Numbers Authority at
https://data.iana.org/TLD/tlds-alpha-by-domain.txt (the version line at
the top of the file records the fetched version). The list is factual
registry data used to tell a domain name from a dotted file name or a
newsgroup, and is refreshed from that source.
